,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_lov_type=>'STATIC'
,p_help_text=>'Design of the timeline. dots: classic rail with state dots. iconRail: icon circles on a rail, date at the end. alternating: events alternate around a center line and collapse to one column when narrow. cards: each event in an elevated card. log: dense audit log with a visible level column. milestones: horizontal roadmap with diamond markers, vertical when narrow. changelog: release notes with the Tag as a version label. numbered: large sequence numbers. dateBlocks: calendar tiles built from the Date. branch: tree connectors, like a thread or commit history.'
);
